                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e8a25baa-c980-4f5f-8fb9-f4d31f19d2d8" type="scandicus" xml:id="m-20524195-7c1a-4746-8cfa-acdc84378aea">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1cf2d369-1355-4c66-96f4-6fd4a239a190" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-2e2d3ecc-face-4310-9cb6-fc68d9a3e7bf" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-2626a832-fe9a-4fac-8f1f-7e05dccefcdc" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-c8083f27-665a-428b-a840-0dede929158c">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-eb516a92-5807-4bbf-8db6-2159e71217b4" type="clivis" xml:id="m-26da1885-08d6-4865-bb4b-785b50a13543">
                  <nc xml:id="m-5d41f6b2-a3bd-414c-90b5-3edb6b862bad" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-a01f3f47-5b56-4224-8b80-59cf48f68c9d" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-37603f75-d91f-4584-81da-0fec9198ba63" facs="#m-11380eee-eb59-4732-9913-d548a725743f" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-6902f51a-b9ef-4a1f-8719-de830f748b66">
            <lg xml:id="m-b2f3e9f8-a3b6-4dad-b423-b0759ff202b6">
              <l xml:id="m-b7ef1785-f9eb-4a02-b955-73aca3d08d7c" facs="#m-48924dc7-f9cd-4a91-9538-f21800c5403b" label="ambiguous">1430</l><l xml:id="m-649272fc-4b25-46c6-9888-6fd0fc6de32a" facs="#m-f68839da-3f59-4037-89ee-8ce6f845f95b" label="ambiguous">April 17. 21.</l><l xml:id="m-6a12045f-56c6-4fde-a384-315734ba17df" facs="#m-a3703f61-2693-442b-bf0c-1b6160430212" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-38220a55-5ee8-4507-8bf5-1c29bad6d9fd" facs="#m-1b0b819f-e0d1-4a21-8262-3bb7090b303f" label="lyrics-like">Unera nostra, Dómine Deus, Justinus advérsus impiórum calúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5a15c43-271b-4570-81f8-26c3a2d72b44" facs="#m-677412fe-d2ee-4260-8866-89c505d8b9bd" label="lyrics-like">114 benignus súscipe; quorum mi-nias strénue deféndit. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f30061d3-8d23-4210-9746-7d66c79dfdab" facs="#m-3b93df40-de2a-4968-bc1a-49559e9d20dc" label="lyrics-like">rábile mystérium sanctus Martyr num nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-7c3a8376-c6df-407b-8857-05ec000c08cc" facs="#m-ff46ffc9-6008-4d2a-8b75-1034ade16dbd" label="lyrics-like">The Holy Martyrs. Secret. Haec hóstia. p. 1477.</l><l xml:id="m-647bfdaa-8048-4ab1-bc49-b0b58edc97d2" facs="#m-1cb43c41-2f03-4951-9cdf-2c089288fc49" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-838aeb82-3ec4-4fe4-9058-84a2e2387503" facs="#m-8b9c0379-b1ea-45db-8ebb-412fc73b17d5" label="lyrics-like">REpó-si-ta est“ mí- hi</l><l xml:id="m-ee03094d-2616-4d3f-b5d9-0689a6fcf933" facs="#m-840c3ed3-f521-428c-97d0-48990680b9d7" label="lyrics-like">co-ró-na justí¬</l><l xml:id="m-4547cf5b-4031-4910-a9e6-ce223e00633f" facs="#m-0360b5d1-1e88-4fec-ad31-aa55dcaad376" label="lyrics-like">ti-ae, quam réddet mí¬ hi Dóminus in îl-la dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb46baf3-1aef-4939-8c56-e83565b398da" facs="#m-cbf7a44d-3c1f-4291-8e66-aaa465ad9923" label="ambiguous">e</l><l xml:id="m-b19d624e-0e69-40c2-bae2-fe963d825b05" facs="#m-63247fc9-cb60-4627-a74d-74cd8c573c8a" label="lyrics-like">jú¬</l><l xml:id="m-330a11d2-2ccc-4cd0-9c30-f0a069166259" facs="#m-01502131-5185-44ec-a684-0250b155112c" label="lyrics-like">stus jú-dex. Alle-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-1baec5ec-f036-45aa-9511-0b8ecc82967b" facs="#m-64f0fcc0-78b6-4d3c-9b02-a7cb8cd96156" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-25a819e1-f112-4960-8271-a188f97573d6" facs="#m-5da497ed-a4dd-48e2-9c33-b14f1ed0cbd8" label="lyrics-like">vAelésti alimónia refécti súppli-l de accéptis donis semper in gratiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-81ea9b98-e9ff-45d5-9c6d-da624e5a1439" facs="#m-c9c29a73-09c2-4244-8811-a747ea9d2416" label="lyrics-like">U ces te, Dómine, deprecámur; ut ] rum actióne maneámus. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-468bfd4b-bd9a-4909-8bf3-0e5df1058d80" facs="#m-e791b4fb-747d-4f27-8691-fa76e439bae4" label="lyrics-like">beãti Justíni Mártyris tui mónitis, ]minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-2a1ab750-670f-4ccd-96c3-4ca5a5f91fd5" facs="#m-df3447ea-302b-4a0f-9397-1e1953150e3f" label="lyrics-like">The Holy Martyrs. Postcommunion. Sacro múnere. p. 1477.</l><l xml:id="m-ebe2bb13-9953-4e49-8a57-8d55750e845a" facs="#m-4566b1da-0ab0-44e1-868a-8200059d776c" label="text-like">St. Anicetus, Pope and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-fbf7e65d-390d-4365-82b3-cd2f2c0604dc" facs="#m-af2a9589-c14a-4903-821e-8a7c9792c01e" label="ambiguous">17.</l><l xml:id="m-61748ec8-cfa9-40ba-a6d4-d45a19391bd4" facs="#m-2da376e3-23ba-4917-9d89-5a0e55783bbc" label="ambiguous">Simple.</l><l xml:id="m-0edf3232-fc37-49f4-9703-5d33ea9f8107" facs="#m-538ebfd8-4205-4d81-9804-21a41ea22108" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a17de198-4088-4c90-8391-dcd6935747d5" facs="#m-f5abcf58-3fbd-4776-8a31-40ddd8d925e6" label="lyrics-like">(Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, tua protectióne custódi; * quem</l><l xml:id="m-aea98bbd-ae7e-436c-9e69-2dc8e45af7c9" facs="#m-7d1e722b-03bf-4ff7-b34c-fc08a2c6351f" label="lyrics-like">U placátus inténde t: et per beã¬us Ecclésiae praestitisti esse</l><l xml:id="m-5de262d2-d08c-4d0a-9d94-8dd74d246b65" facs="#m-74aac021-051e-492f-a35c-9247dee1785d" label="lyrics-like">tum Anicétum Mártyrem tuu pastórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9e925ee9-13e9-4d5a-abcf-a03c4593f093" facs="#m-313e6418-7ccb-4449-98b4-e29ca4a733ea" label="lyrics-like">atque Summum Pontíficem, perpé¬</l><l xml:id="m-413c2f68-e846-4102-8256-8c130da19549" facs="#m-dd5012bb-0251-474f-88e8-bd132fe53bac" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Oblátis. p. 1122° and Postcommunion. Refectióne. p. 1123.</l><l xml:id="m-4ae51eac-8c0c-4ae8-a570-f1156de96149" facs="#m-565fd25d-be50-4023-a05e-c9af8f0b5a87" label="text-like">21. St. Anselm, Bishop. Confessor, and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-4190d308-b850-4862-aa1e-c3a847013a9c" facs="#m-e0c2b383-2d7c-43c4-bca2-3a228ac36c67" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-04ffbde1-fb17-481f-8c46-529c59dbc9dc" facs="#m-badb53f6-df96-4d42-b455-0a72d1a4cbc2" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor óptime... beáte</l><l xml:id="m-66a633d0-3a22-4542-a667-085b621ba3e2" facs="#m-65a4cbb6-b694-447f-9925-6231c092be37" label="lyrics-like">Ansélme. p. 262s.</l><l xml:id="m-b6d2e4b1-e61d-43f3-b0e7-2fcf1679c063" facs="#m-df4eed55-5903-4607-86bc-6857721a9283" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. of Doctors, p. 1190. The Credo is said.</l><l xml:id="m-320320d8-4610-43c8-ba32-8fbc13bd27bf" facs="#m-c21ac9e5-ace4-430b-9b16-c288a15ab313" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-d1ef8127-02f7-4e4d-88b2-f10250a1d946" facs="#m-6fdb0dbd-6008-437b-bcfa-2c3ae1a2c26d" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pópulo tuo aetérnae ut quem Doctórem vitae habúimu:</l><l xml:id="m-a0a8688f-732c-4c4c-b89b-bc31edea92b4" facs="#m-5833688e-9954-42d3-be88-e307d6f8bd2b" label="lyrics-like">I salútis beátum Ansélmum mini-in terris, *intercessórem habére</l><l xml:id="m-81b6432d-f53c-4b34-84f2-a8b20a00a200" facs="#m-b4564a6b-08b7-4a43-b153-9660178d3536" label="lyrics-like">strumtribuisti: tpraesta, quaésumus; l mereámur in caelis. Per Dóminum</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>